{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415668","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415668","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041566801:1":{"text":"엄마, 치치가 놀러 가고 싶대요. 저다 같이 가도 돼요?","source_cn":"妈妈，奇奇说想出去玩，我能一起去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC686DEA39BF93AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566802:1":{"text":"밖은 위험하지만... 그래, 나가도 된단다.","source_cn":"外面很危险……好吧，你可以出去玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11F4CB0A6A21D669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566803:1":{"text":"근데 외투부터 입어야지?","source_cn":"但你得先穿上外套。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8580A786418499F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566804:1":{"text":"이번에는 좀 더 도톰하게 만들어 봤어. 지난번에는 자수가 너무 화려하다고 했지? 그래서 이번에는 단색이란다.","source_cn":"妈妈给你缝了一件厚些的，你说过，上次的绣花有些花哨，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF7C50DB19271959","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566805:1":{"text":"소매가 좀 긴 것 같긴 한데... 입어 보렴. 마음에 드니?","source_cn":"袖子好像做长了一些，你先看看合不合身，样子喜不喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04F1A4CCC3D9B47C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566806:1":{"text":"예뻐요! 소매도 딱 맞아요. 엄마가 만들어주시는 거면 전부 다 좋아요.","source_cn":"很好看，袖子也刚刚好。无论妈妈做什么我都喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79142D6E392CBAE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566807:1":{"text":"그런데 이 옷은 특별히 더 마음에 들어요. 치치도 좋대요!","source_cn":"不过这件我格外喜欢——奇奇也喜欢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE241474D193B6030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566808:1":{"text":"그럼 다음에 엄마가 치치의 옷도 만들어 줄까? 어떤 걸 만들어 줄까, 치마가 좋겠니?","source_cn":"那下次妈妈也给奇奇做一件吧？要做怎样的，裙子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1BB83A5201A1754","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566809:1":{"text":"아뇨. 치치는 아빠처럼 긴 로브를 입고 싶대요.","source_cn":"不行，奇奇想穿爸爸那样的袍子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD3423EF9771229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566810:1":{"text":"아, 그 얘기를 들으니 니루의 옷도 두 벌 정도는 새로 만들어야겠구나.","source_cn":"啊，这倒提醒我了，也要给尼汝缝两件新衣服了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E626AF257E02CE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566811:1":{"text":"엄마도 새 치마가 필요하지 않아요? 사실 비밀인데요, 아빠가 엄마 몰래 새 치마를 준비해 뒀더라고요.","source_cn":"妈妈，你也需要一条新裙子——我看到了哦，爸爸偷偷给你准...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02B432BAEA74DABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566812:1":{"text":"며칠 뒤에 저희 온 가족 다 같이 새 옷 입고 나들이 가요!","source_cn":"过几天，我们一起穿着新衣服出门吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F719EDB8132877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:戴蒙":{"text":"데이먼","source":"戴蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"세미라","source":"雪米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}